  "name": "Aura of Warding (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 19th level, the paladin becomes immune to magical aging effects and adds her Charisma bonus (if any) as a bonus to her touch AC. Allies within 10 feet of the paladin add the paladin's Charisma bonus as a bonus to touch AC. This bonus cannot make her touch AC go above her normal AC, nor can it make an ally's touch AC exceed their normal AC. This aura functions only while the paladin is conscious, not if she is unconscious or dead.</p>",
